sections.Path of Glory:
The following medals in Path of Glory are related to pariticipating in Trial of Swordmancy:
{{Medal head}}
{{Medal cell
|name = "Zenith of the Trials"
|desc = With impeccable tact, you ascended the zenith in the Trial of Swordmancy.
|cond = Complete 1 Trial with a total of 10 Battle Points
|trim = After 1 instance of Data Overflow, complete 1 Trial with a total of 10 Battle Points The trimming condition for this medal may be misunderstood. Trimming this medal requires the player to complete a single Trial with a total of 21 Battle Points since overflowing occurs at 11 Battle Points, resetting the counter to 0 and any more Battle Points afterwards increases the counter again. Additionally, the Data Overflow and the 10 leftover Battle Points must occur in a single Trial. Simply completing a Trial with 10 Battle Points after encountering Data Overflow in a previous Trial does not work. Both medals may also be obtained in Free Trial Mode.}}
